","Žinoma, jokių problemų.","53ab965153cd",1.32],[0,"Have you been to our office before?","Ar anksčiau esate buvęs mūsų klinikoje?","1c2f1a98bfc0",1.63],[-1,"No, I've been there before.","Ne, jau esu buvęs pas Jus.",1],[0,"Welcome back!","Sveiki sugrįžę!","c4562896dc1e",0.93],[0,"And what's your name, please?","O koks Jūsų vardas ir pavardė?","2299a990f144",1.39],[-1,"My name is Tomas Mikalauskas.","Mano vardas – Tomas Mikalauskas.",1],[0,"Could you spell your last name for me?","Ar galėtumėte man pasakyti savo pavardę paraidžiui?","8491ef747add",1.79],[-1,"It's M, I, K, A, L, A, U, S, K, A, S.","M-I-K-A-L-A-U-S-K-A-S.",1],[0,"Got it, thank you.","Supratau, ačiū.","d3a416bcc2e6",1.31],[0,"Can I have your date of birth, please?","Ar galėčiau sužinoti Jūsų gimimo datą?","acfe8b87665e",1.47],[-1,"June fourth, nineteen ninety.","1990 m. birželio 4 d.",1],[0,"Perfect.","Puiku.","5d53520522f3",0.71],[0,"Let me check the schedule. Can you hold for a moment?","Tuoj patikrinsiu tvarkaraštį. Ar galite akimirką palaukti?","f2da82a2a8f7",2.55],[-1,"Of course.","Žinoma.",1],[0,"Thanks for holding!","Ačiū, kad palaukėte!","cd4451483778",0.86],[0,"I have an opening Tuesday at ten. Does that work for you?","Turiu laisvo laiko antradienį 10:00. Ar Jums tinka?","bde107a53dbd",3.41],[-1,"That works for me.","Man tinka.",1],[0,"Great! So that's Tuesday at ten.","Puiku! Taigi antradienį 10:00.","571cc406b3aa",2.48],[0,"And please bring a photo ID.","Ir prašom atsinešti dokumentą su nuotrauka.","73cea51b6679",1.8],[0,"Can I help you with anything else?","Ar dar kuo nors galiu padėti?","0744e603a86c",1.44],[-1,"Goodbye!","Viso gero!",1],[0,"See you!","Iki!","73705dd70880",0.7],[0,"Good morning, Green Street Dental! Linda speaking. How may I help you?","Labas rytas, „Green Street Dental“! Klauso Linda. Kuo galėčiau padėti?","bb442cf5f42c",3.52],[-1,"I have a toothache.","Man skauda dantį.",1],[0,"Oh no, I'm sorry to hear that.","O ne, gaila tai girdėti.","4dfb9816b242",2.06],[0,"How long have you had this pain?","Kiek laiko Jus kankina šis skausmas?","b7923bd9200b",1.43],[-1,"For three days.","Jau tris dienas.",1],[0,"I see.","Suprantu.","27addb323704",0.61],[-1,"Yes, I'm a new patient.","Taip, aš naujas pacientas.",1],[0,"Okay, no problem.","Gerai, jokių problemų.","8ba91f461cfb",1.39],[0,"Can I have your first and last name, please?","Ar galėčiau sužinoti Jūsų vardą ir pavardę?","5629b54f0986",1.93],[-1,"My last name is Mikalauskas.","Mano pavardė – Mikalauskas.",1],[0,"And your last name?","O Jūsų pavardė?","68339a20d09e",1.07],[0,"And what's your date of birth?","O kokia Jūsų gimimo data?","fd86759baa14",1.6],[0,"Thank you.","Ačiū.","59689283fb5e",0.81],[0,"And a phone number, please?","O Jūsų telefono numeris?","b352e37e6dfa",1.37],[-1,"My number is five five five, two oh one, seven seven eight eight.","Mano numeris – 555-201-7788.",1],[0,"Great, thank you.","Puiku, ačiū.","55382d02fff8",1.52],[0,"Do you have dental insurance?","Ar turite odontologinį draudimą?","779ce0d9b906",1.56],[-1,"Yes, I have dental insurance.","Taip, turiu odontologinį draudimą.",1],[0,"Great. Please bring your insurance card.","Puiku. Prašom atsinešti draudimo kortelę.","166c0d50e789",1.97],[-1,"Sure, no problem.","Žinoma, jokių problemų.",1],[0,"Okay, let's find you something soon.","Gerai, suraskime Jums laiką kuo greičiau.","84fec21ea470",1.91],[0,"We have Tuesday at ten. Would that work?","Turime antradienį 10:00. Ar tiktų?","f4b5dbd71950",2.51],[-1,"Tomorrow at eight fifteen is perfect.","Rytoj 8:15 – puiku.",1],[0,"Perfect! You're all set for tomorrow at eight fifteen.","Puiku! Užregistravau Jus rytoj 8:15.","916bd8279d01",2.85],[0,"Please come ten minutes early to fill out some forms.","Prašom atvykti dešimčia minučių anksčiau – reikės užpildyti kelias formas.","6102e57ec8cc",2.48],[0,"Anything else I can do for you?","Ar dar kuo nors galiu padėti?","47454ce403f0",1.47],[-1,"Have a nice day!","Geros dienos!",1],[0,"Bye! Have a great day!","Iki! Puikios dienos!","5871db66e768",1.27],[0,"Green Street Dental, this is Linda. How can I help you?","„Green Street Dental“, klauso Linda. Kuo galiu padėti?","58086ace79af",2.58],[-1,"I'd like to make an appointment.","Norėčiau užsiregistruoti vizitui.",1],[0,"Sure! Is it for a checkup, or is something bothering you?","Žinoma! Ar tai profilaktinė patikra, ar kas nors vargina?","8b9a4095013d",3.19],[-1,"I lost a filling.","Man iškrito plomba.",1],[0,"Okay.","Gerai.","3c9f0d0e097e",0.64],[0,"Are you a new patient?","Ar Jūs naujas pacientas?","0f91519a8226",1.02],[0,"Thank you. And how do you spell that?","Ačiū. O kaip ji rašoma?","b0205cc2c56d",1.94],[0,"Perfect, thanks.","Puiku, ačiū.","3c12f992f7a0",1.26],[0,"How about Tuesday at ten?","Gal antradienį 10:00?","42d3dbbb3b55",1.5],[-1,"That would be great, thanks.","Būtų puiku, ačiū.",1],[0,"Perfect! You're all set for Tuesday at ten.","Puiku! Užregistravau Jus antradienį 10:00.","29807a1ebd65",2.45],[-1,"Where can I park?","Kur galiu pastatyti automobilį?",1],[0,"There's free parking behind the building.","Už pastato yra nemokama stovėjimo aikštelė.","e4b9ec1b9124",1.96],[-1,"No, that's all. Thank you!","Ne, tai viskas. Ačiū!",1],[0,"Thanks for calling. See you Tuesday!","Ačiū, kad paskambinote. Iki antradienio!","d171354a5abb",1.75],[-1,"I'm calling to make an appointment.","Skambinu norėdamas užsiregistruoti vizitui.",1],[0,"Of course. What's going on?","Žinoma. Kas nutiko?","a5c3969811a1",1.39],[-1,"Since Monday.","Nuo pirmadienio.",1],[0,"Okay, got it.","Gerai, supratau.","c0bca4a320c2",1.28],[-1,"I was born on June fourth, nineteen ninety.","Gimiau 1990 m. birželio 4 d.",1],[0,"Great! So that's tomorrow at eight fifteen.","Puiku! Taigi rytoj 8:15.","232d4eff9049",3.15],[-1,"Yes, please.","Taip, prašau.",1],[0,"Sure, what can I do for you?","Žinoma, kuo galiu padėti?","ad4f0b88445d",1.62],[-1,"See you tomorrow!","Iki rytojaus!",1],[0,"Thanks for calling. See you tomorrow!","Ačiū, kad paskambinote. Iki rytojaus!","d919f2c209c5",2],[0